      "writtenOn": "2024-03-21T18:57:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay, I added a public `findOrCreateCompatibleSamplerKnownKey` method instead. \n\nFor now it\u0027s only called internally to the class it\u0027s defined in, but will come in handy later when we need to find (or create) a sampler during pipeline layout initialization. At that time, we will have access to the necessary sampler key and it would be a waste to recreate it.\n\nAlong w/ other changes I\u0027ve made since first hacking all of this together, I do believe we can remove the `GraphiteResourceKey` from `createSampler(...)`!\n\nI appreciate your thoughtful review :D",
